## 8. Technical Decisions
| Date | Decision | Reason | Alternatives considered |
|---|---|---|---|
| 2026-11-16 | Project root = EEI6369 folder (not a `store-management-api/` subfolder) | `.github/workflows` must sit at repo root for Actions to run; keeps `.plan` in the same repo | Subfolder + repo at subfolder |
| 2026-11-16 | Spring Boot 3.3.5, springdoc 2.6.0, no Lombok | Stable, Java 17 compatible; Lombok optional, records/plain getters avoid annotation-processing issues | Boot 3.4/3.5, Lombok |
| 2026-11-16 | Flyway owns schema; Hibernate `ddl-auto: validate` everywhere | Spec: schema validation in prod; reproducible schema on RDS | `ddl-auto: update` (rejected for prod) |
| 2026-11-16 | Tests use H2 in PostgreSQL mode running the real Flyway migration | Tests run without Docker on any machine/CI; still validates schema | Testcontainers (needs Docker) |
| 2026-11-16 | Pessimistic write lock for stock changes + DB CHECK constraints | Prevent negative stock under concurrency | Optimistic @Version |
| 2026-11-16 | Insufficient stock and duplicates → HTTP 409; validation → 400 | Conventional REST semantics | 422 |
| 2026-11-16 | Health: `show-components: always`, `show-details: never` | Matches required response shape without leaking DB info | show-details always |
| 2026-11-16 | CI publishes image to GHCR using GITHUB_TOKEN | No extra secrets needed; EC2 can `docker pull` | Docker Hub / ECR |

